## 📬 Outreach Toolkit

### Roles to Target

When searching for contacts at Tier 3 & 4 companies, look for these job titles:

1. **Editorial Directors** (Often hold the creative keys)
2. **Audio or Digital Media Managers** (Direct decision makers)
3. **Rights & Licensing Contacts** (Backlist management)
4. **Head of Production**

### Template 1: Email for Indie Publishers

**Subject:** Affordable AI Audiobook Production for {{Publisher Name}}

> Hi {{Name}},
> I’m Jim, founder of **Narrate-AI**. We help publishers quickly turn books into narrated audiobooks starting at **£20–£25 per title**.
> I know independent presses like {{Publisher Name}} often have valuable backlists that haven't been converted to audio due to high studio costs. I’d love to show you how a **free sample chapter** sounds with our premium narration.
> If you like the result, we can convert a full title in days, keeping **you in control of the rights and files**.
> Are you open to hearing a 2-minute sample?
> Best,
> Jim
> Narrate-AI | {{Your Website}}

### Template 2: LinkedIn DM for Production Studios

> Hi {{Name}}, I’m the founder of **Narrate-AI** — an AI-narration service helping studios generate high-quality audiobook audio from existing text at a fraction of standard costs (from £20 per book).
> If you’d ever like to offer this as a "budget tier" production option to your clients or test it with a pilot title, let’s connect!

